+*   **Boundary Overlap:** If the mesh bounding box exactly overlaps voxel surfaces, intersection determination may fail if the box is not expanded by half a voxel unit [S7].
+*   **Vertical Lines:** In scanline fill, vertical lines ($x_0 = x_1$) return $Y=-1$ from interpolation, effectively skipping them [S9, unofficial].
 
